{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6f23a24ef3e5f6b646cc5bf2ea0046b5c089b0b7b92aeda1557c0d048455d93f", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の撮影が始まる。\n環のテーマは『スライム』だが……）", "zh": "（写真杂志合作企划的拍摄开始了。\n环的主题是“史莱姆”，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "888d3df3574d3a0fa0a0aeb2417059b5a1c01837a971f13c16fca2c8cfb32075", "ja": "バーってして、シュッてやって、それから……。\nう～ん。これだと、あんまりかっこよくないかも？", "zh": "先来个“啪——”，再“咻——”，然后……  \n嗯～。这样的话，好像不太帅气？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "7b347dc731858267c4b75961f85a6fccc50addac867ee7f5b6159929b2d91b20", "ja": "やっぱり、もっと強そうなのがいいよね！\nえ～っと……。", "zh": "还是更厉害一点的比较好吧！\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1003_p", "source_sha256": "00ca117c646df83f0ccebaeae8cb66db4f1701d9d51772d17bdb4ba9f6c2cb9d", "ja": "どうしたんだ、環？　なにか悩んでるみたいだけど。", "zh": "怎么了，环？你好像在烦恼什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "34ed7bce1e617434485fdb824e33657df1c5b43ae7bc5cb9bad7b2403eec05b0", "ja": "あ、おやぶん！　今ね、スライムの必殺技を\n考えてたんだ。でも、いいのが思いつかなくて……。", "zh": "啊，大哥！我刚才在想史莱姆的必杀技。可是怎么也想不出什么好点子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "87d7d5006aa58cfe10557df700c4a2f78e06f4fe75aad6467692f2ec8d593329", "ja": "おやぶんも、たまきと一緒に考えて！\nかっこよくて、みんなもマネしたくなる必殺技！", "zh": "大叔也和小环一起想嘛！\n要设计出又帅气、又能让大家都想模仿的必杀技！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1006_p", "source_sha256": "73312aede05f718d88db948d94e2666de1110ae5c36768524df3493cc36a01c0", "ja": "それは、なかなか大変だな……。スライムだし、\n体当たり！とか、とびかかる！じゃダメか？", "zh": "这可不太容易啊……毕竟是史莱姆，撞上去！或者扑上去！之类的，不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "7bccb35d3e65ae563a1c681d18c3fa4f5c7bd19a19c154c7730eadcd7e986800", "ja": "え～、体当たり？\n全然、必殺技って感じがしないぞ……。", "zh": "诶～，撞上去？完全没有必杀技的感觉啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1008_p", "source_sha256": "313efb2ae4bbb4167660d1593ef7dfaef6e18ac2c928c7b6c48e122648c35609", "ja": "そ、そうか……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "dff535c04d1ea36fb0b065bd79e31ce1717c77ba0964011d9dc99696e1ee4430", "ja": "うん。モンスターの必殺技だから、もっとすごいのが\nいいと思うんだ。ドラゴンとか勇者を倒せそうなやつ！", "zh": "嗯。因为是怪兽的必杀技，环觉得更厉害一点\n的比较好。像是能打倒巨龙或者勇者那种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1010_p", "source_sha256": "92c4608bf5faca0ff77e51cfb61298dc6faa8c5e10f50e92e7448736ca6a9d25", "ja": "えっ、勇者も？　難易度が上がったなぁ。\n環、もっと詳しく教えてくれないか？", "zh": "诶，连勇者也要打倒吗？难度提高了啊。\n环，能不能再详细说说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "374d051d092f6eefaffa07cafb6318e1321ab0e9b93992a85770240ce3750542", "ja": "うんと、パンチしたら爆発するとか？　……あっ。\nスライムなら、おっきくなって爆発とかできるかも！？", "zh": "嗯，比如说，打上一拳就会爆炸之类的？……啊。\n史莱姆的话，说不定可以变大后爆炸！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "88416bb3260d71084ff0d8526f421a2ddcdebfd187f8c60584999a8a03be4394", "ja": "ドッガーンって！　それなら、すっごく強そうだよね！\n敵もぜーんぶ吹き飛ばしちゃうぞ～！", "zh": "砰地一下！那样的话，感觉会超级厉害呢！\n把敌人全都炸飞吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1013_p", "source_sha256": "466f9c319c9f69572fb186f58eaad4240f37fd8efcf6dc5d4d10a9882e681ec4", "ja": "全部……。とにかく、環の中では、\nなんだかすごそうな技をイメージしてるんだな。", "zh": "全都……总之，在环的想象里，似乎是种很厉害的招式啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4a7ced8f878fedbac106395e29d43df33e073c8ba9b50cf49911a82df242f8f6", "ja": "そうだな。あとは……ものすごく高くジャンプして\n空からキックする、なんていうのはどうだ？", "zh": "是啊。还有……像是跳得特别高，然后从空中踢下来的招式，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "5c0cdd1229d63a9f7a3ffcb1b7247118dbf799242ab0a6f8d64ffa7732dc3115", "ja": "わあ～、すごくかっこいいぞ！　じゃあ、必殺技の\n名前は……『たまきスライムスーパーすごいキック』！", "zh": "哇～，太帅啦！那必杀技的\n名字就叫……“环环史莱姆超级厉害飞踢”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0653_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0653_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "b3fdb3c2098b90796bc539b49d5b50aa4a7f0d87f5b3705aa9973e6a323f0d9c", "ja": "くふふ♪　ぜったい、みんなマネしたくなるぞ……！\nおやぶん、さっそく必殺技、練習してみるね♪", "zh": "咕呼呼♪大家绝对都会想学着做的……！\n老大，我这就开始练习必杀技啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
